        <item>
            <title>1.12.0</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 10:44:12 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>13</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.12.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Macbrow 1.12.0</h2>
<ul>
<li>Macbrow Pro: new installs get 14 days of everything. After that, the Shelf, music, the battery and the Clock stay free, and the rest asks for Pro. One payment of €7.99, no subscription.</li>
<li>If you were already using Macbrow, nothing changes: you have Pro for life, with no key and no notice.</li>
<li>Nothing is ever deleted when the trial ends. Your settings and your clipboard history are kept, and Pro features simply stop running until you activate a key.</li>
<li>A key works on up to 3 Macs. Activate it in Settings &gt; License; deactivating it on one Mac does not give the use back.</li>
<li>You get a short heads-up 3 days before the trial ends and on its last day, once each. Locked features show a small lock in the notch.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
