        <item>
            <title>1.10.0</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 22:51:46 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>11</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.10.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Macbrow 1.10.0</h2>
<ul>
<li>Welcome: a short first-run tour inside the notch shows how to open Macbrow and lets you pick your pet.</li>
<li>The pet is now on by default. If you turned it off, it stays off.</li>
<li>Pet reactions: confetti when a Focus session ends or you complete a Checkmate task, a moon while you are in a meeting, and an umbrella when rain is coming in the next hour. Turn them off in Settings &gt; Appearance &gt; Pet.</li>
<li>Share from the Shelf: right-click an item to share it, send it with AirDrop or copy its path.</li>
<li>Settings &gt; About: find the other Mac apps from Jetforge Labs.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
