        <item>
            <title>1.6.0</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 16:09:59 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>7</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.6.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Macbrow 1.6.0</h2>
<ul>
<li>Integrations: connect the apps you use in Settings &gt; Integrations, then pull the handle on the notch's bottom edge to open a drawer with one tab per integration.</li>
<li>Calendar: every upcoming event for the next 14 days, grouped by day. Reminders: overdue, today's and upcoming reminders, and you can tick them off from the notch. Shortcuts: run your shortcuts with one click.</li>
<li>Checkmate: overdue, today's and upcoming tasks. Dilo: recording status and your recent meetings and notes. LimitBar: your Claude and Codex usage at a glance.</li>
<li>The drawer opens from any tab, keeps its height when you switch tabs, and the notch no longer closes if the pointer slips just past the bottom edge.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
