            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Macbrow 1.3.0</h2>
<ul>
<li>Event reminders: shortly before an event starts, the closed notch gently expands and shows a pulsing dot in the calendar's colour with the time left. Click it to see the event's details. Turn it on or off and choose how early (1, 2, 5, 10 or 15 minutes) in Settings &gt; Calendar.</li>
<li>The event in progress is now highlighted in the calendar.</li>
<li>Reorder the shelf: drag an item to a new position inside the shelf. The order is kept after a restart.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
